flowchart TD
  S["Select current Task version"] --> D{"Dependencies and entry criteria satisfied?"}
  D -->|No| B["BLOCKED + typed reason"]
  D -->|Yes| C{"Context current and sufficient?"}
  C -->|No| Q["Open or link Architecture Question"]
  C -->|Yes| K{"Frozen decisions and Specs loaded?"}
  K -->|No| B
  K -->|Yes| P{"Required capability available and policy allows?"}
  P -->|No| Q
  P -->|Yes| E["Execute within Work Package"]
  E --> V["Verify result and evidence"]
  V --> H{"Human authority required?"}
  H -->|Yes| R["HUMAN_REVIEW / escalation"]
  H -->|No| U["Propose StateUpdateDelta"]
  R --> U
  U --> A{"Version, evidence and policy still valid?"}
  A -->|No| B
  A -->|Yes| N["Apply receipt + identify next Work"]

